{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24372","headline":"三月三日祓禊洛滨 · 白居易","name":"三月三日祓禊洛滨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月草萋萋，黄莺歇又啼。\n柳桥晴有絮，沙路润无泥。\n禊事修初半，游人到欲齐。\n金钿耀桃李，丝管骇凫鷖。\n转岸回船尾，临流簇马蹄。\n闹翻扬子渡，蹋破魏王堤。\n妓接谢公宴，诗陪荀令题。\n舟同李膺泛，醴爲穆生携。\n水引春心荡，花牵醉眼迷。\n尘街从鼓动，烟树任鸦栖。\n舞急红腰软，歌迟翠黛低。\n夜归何用烛，新月凤楼西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}